  "version": "1.0",
  "disclaimer": "Automated analysis draft for attorney review only. This is not legal advice, does not create an attorney-client relationship, and does not predict how any court, arbitrator or agency will rule. Pattern matching can miss or mis-flag clauses. Enforceability of many provisions is jurisdiction-dependent; items marked 'verify for jurisdiction' require review under applicable law by a licensed attorney.",
